Calling monsters and naming objects seems to be one of
most problematic things, or at least it's very often asked
about in #NetHack IRC channel on freenode.

The following patch changes the 'N' command to use a menu,
and adds an option to christen monsters in the same menu;
this could be used to free the 'C' key for some other command.

-------
What do you want to name:

o - an individual object
c - a class of objects
m - a monster
(end)

